  "id": "d1272f1472b8ca6b898f91b5",
  "title": "为 Nexus 5 编译 Android Lollipop 固件",
  "summary": "技术复核（2026-10-13） ：这是一篇 Nexus 5 / Android Lollipop 的历史教程，设备与工具链已过期。文中的 LRX22C 二进制对应 **Android 5.0.1 / AOSP android-5.0.1_r1 **，下文据此明确源码、驱动和刷机条件。新学习环境另补 Android 16 Cuttlefish 示例；不要把新版本的构建命令与旧真机固件混用。 接前一篇文章 使用Android Studio查看Android Lollipop源码 , 我们知道,仅仅看代码,提高是比较有限的,而且理解起来也比较肤浅,往往过目就忘. 而自己写过的代码,往往会印象比较深刻,在写的时候也会比较容易理解流程. 所以我们在看代码的同时, 如果能修改代码, 在手机上跑起来并看到修改的效果,这无…",
  "content": "<blockquote><p><strong>技术复核（2026-10-13）</strong>：这是一篇 Nexus 5 / Android Lollipop 的历史教程，设备与工具链已过期。文中的 LRX22C 二进制对应 **Android 5.0.1 / AOSP <code>android-5.0.1_r1</code>**，下文据此明确源码、驱动和刷机条件。新学习环境另补 Android 16 Cuttlefish 示例；不要把新版本的构建命令与旧真机固件混用。</p></blockquote><p>接前一篇文章<a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2015/01/16/view-android-source-code-with-androidstudio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用Android Studio查看Android Lollipop源码</a>, 我们知道,仅仅看代码,提高是比较有限的,而且理解起来也比较肤浅,往往过目就忘. 而自己写过的代码,往往会印象比较深刻,在写的时候也会比较容易理解流程. 所以我们在看代码的同时, 如果能修改代码, 在手机上跑起来并看到修改的效果,这无疑会加快看代码的效率和积极性. 所以这篇文章,就讲解一下如何自己编译AndroidL的源码,并且在Nexus5上跑起来. 至于为何需要自己编译固件，而不是直接安装 Google 给出的工厂固件？这里的目的是获得便于平台调试的 userdebug 构建。user 版本限制 ADB root 等调试能力；userdebug 支持更多调试操作，但并不等于任意分区都能不受限制地写入。</p><p>本文假设你已准备好版本一致的 Lollipop 源码和一台 Nexus 5。环境可参考 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/start/older-versions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">旧版本 AOSP 构建说明</a>和<a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">源码下载说明</a>。Android 5.x 在 Linux 上使用 OpenJDK 7；旧系统与依赖应放在专门的历史构建环境中，不能直接作为当前开发机的安装建议。如果访问官方文档或下载源码不顺畅，需要先处理网络与源码获取环境。</p><p>AOSP 是 Android Open Source Project，即 Android 开源项目。它包含平台和开源应用，不包含 Google Mobile Services（GMS）这组专有应用与服务。厂商二进制、GMS 授权和 Android 兼容性是不同问题：满足 CDD 并通过 CTS 是兼容性要求，不等于自动获得 GMS。具体要求可以参见 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/compatibility/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 兼容性说明</a>。</p><span></span><h3><a title=\"现在从哪里开始：Android 16 Cuttlefish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>现在从哪里开始：Android 16 Cuttlefish</h3><p>如果目的是修改系统代码并观察效果，可以先使用 Cuttlefish 虚拟设备。下面把源码固定到 <code>android-16.0.0_r1</code>，与本文旧 Nexus 5 工作区分开，在已满足 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/start/requirements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Linux 构建条件</a>的新目录中执行：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>repo init --partial-clone -b android-16.0.0_r1 -u https://android.googlesource.com/platform/manifest</span><br><span>repo <span>sync</span> -c -j8</span><br><span><span>source</span> build/envsetup.sh</span><br><span>lunch aosp_cf_x86_64_only_phone-aosp_current-userdebug</span><br><span>m</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个产品存在于该标签的 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/device/google/cuttlefish/+/android-16.0.0_r1/AndroidProducts.mk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cuttlefish 配置</a>，<code>aosp_current</code> 在该版本<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/build/release/+/android-16.0.0_r1/release_config_map.textproto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">映射到 bp2a</a>。构建完还需要按 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/start#launch_cuttlefish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cuttlefish 启动说明</a>配置宿主包、KVM 和用户组；<code>m</code> 成功并不代表虚拟机已经启动。</p><p>官方入门文档中的 <code>android-latest-release</code> 是滚动分支，重现实验时应记录实际 manifest。要做真机开发，则逐版本确认设备源码、厂商二进制、bootloader 和基带的配套关系；下载页中存在某个 Pixel 或 Nexus 的旧条目，不代表它受所有新版本支持。</p><h3><a title=\"1. 初始化编译环境（Android 5.0.1）\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>1. 初始化编译环境（Android 5.0.1）</h3><p>下面回到旧 Nexus 5 工作区。根据 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/reference/build-numbers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AOSP 版本表</a>，LRX22C 对应 <code>android-5.0.1_r1</code>。确认整个源码树使用这一版本，再在源码根目录执行：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>source</span> build/envsetup.sh</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"2. 加载机型\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>2. 加载机型</h3><p>旧分支可运行 <code>lunch</code> 查看菜单，也可以直接选择目标，避免依赖菜单编号：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>lunch aosp_hammerhead-userdebug</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"3. 确认设备和构建类型\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>3. 确认设备和构建类型</h3><h4><a title=\"3.1 本文使用的机型\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>3.1 本文使用的机型</h4><table><thead><tr><th>设备</th><th>设备代号</th><th>Android 5.0.1 构建目标</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nexus 5（GSM/LTE）</td><td>hammerhead</td><td><code>aosp_hammerhead-userdebug</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>原机型列表混合了不同年代的产品名与目标名，不能用来判断某个源码标签的支持范围。其他设备应以所选源码树中的产品配置为准，不能只把 <code>hammerhead</code> 换成另一个代号。</p><h4><a title=\"3.2 三种构建变体\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>3.2 三种构建变体</h4><table><thead><tr><th>构建变体</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>user</code></td><td>面向生产，调试访问受限</td></tr><tr><td><code>userdebug</code></td><td>接近 user 的配置，增加 root 调试等能力，适合平台开发</td></tr><tr><td><code>eng</code></td><td>工程开发配置，调试行为更多，不宜直接代表生产性能</td></tr></tbody></table><p>这里应确认的配置值是：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>PLATFORM_VERSION=5.0.1</span><br><span>TARGET_PRODUCT=aosp_hammerhead</span><br><span>TARGET_BUILD_VARIANT=userdebug</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>版本号以所选源码标签为准。日志中的 <code>TARGET_BUILD_TYPE=release</code> 与 <code>TARGET_BUILD_VARIANT=userdebug</code> 可以同时出现，二者不是同一个配置项。</p><h3><a title=\"4. 准备厂商二进制\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>4. 准备厂商二进制</h3><p>在 <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/android/drivers#hammerheadlrx22c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google 二进制下载页的 hammerhead / LRX22C 项</a>取得对应包。它们补充开源树里没有的硬件支持文件，不是 PC 上的 USB 驱动。下面列出了官网公布的 SHA-256。</p><table><thead><tr><th>硬件组件</th><th>供应商</th><th>下载</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NFC, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi</td><td>Broadcom</td><td><a href=\"https://dl.google.com/dl/android/aosp/broadcom-hammerhead-lrx22c-964d941e.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LRX22C</a></td></tr><tr><td>Camera, Sensors, Audio</td><td>LG</td><td><a href=\"https://dl.google.com/dl/android/aosp/lge-hammerhead-lrx22c-95a9d465.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LRX22C</a></td></tr><tr><td>Graphics, GSM, Camera, GPS, Sensors, Media, DSP, USB</td><td>Qualcomm</td><td><a href=\"https://dl.google.com/dl/android/aosp/qcom-hammerhead-lrx22c-e1a10593.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LRX22C</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p>官网 SHA-256：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>broadcom-hammerhead-lrx22c-964d941e.tgz</span><br><span>fa1ba5bbb304940fd9b852f184f37e2c6ce8c8b97e83fa8dea7c125778d3d63a</span><br><span></span><br><span>lge-hammerhead-lrx22c-95a9d465.tgz</span><br><span>84b1c5b8f16b61ae8faeed7fe0593cb882212b05f872dc2d423681d6fe9b964d</span><br><span></span><br><span>qcom-hammerhead-lrx22c-e1a10593.tgz</span><br><span>b5598e88d069b82c8e6db0dc992090baf1d5d1e0a76ed76aeccad0ed65c2d766</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>下载后先按官网校验值核对文件，再解压并阅读各包的许可与说明。在源码根目录运行其提取脚本、按提示完成许可步骤，文件会写入 <code>vendor/</code>。三个供应商的包各有用途，不能重复装 LG 包来替代 Qualcomm 包，也不要混用别的构建编号。</p><h3><a title=\"5. 执行编译命令\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>5. 执行编译命令</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>make -j8</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>-j8</code> 是原环境的并发示例，需要结合 CPU、内存和实际构建情况调整。完整构建应正常退出，并在 <code>out/target/product/hammerhead/</code> 下得到刷机所需的产物。只看到 <code>system.img</code> 生成，不等于整个构建已经成功。</p><p>编译要等上一阵子。下面是当时留下的一段日志，记录的是 system 镜像生成阶段：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Installed file list: out/target/product/hammerhead/installed-files.txt</span><br><span>Target system fs image: out/target/product/hammerhead/obj/PACKAGING/systemimage_intermediates/system.img</span><br><span>Running:  mkuserimg.sh -s out/target/product/hammerhead/system out/target/product/hammerhead/obj/PACKAGING/systemimage_intermediates/system.img ext4 system 1073741824 -L system out/target/product/hammerhead/root/file_contexts</span><br><span>make_ext4fs -s -T -1 -S out/target/product/hammerhead/root/file_contexts -L system -l 1073741824 -a system out/target/product/hammerhead/obj/PACKAGING/systemimage_intermediates/system.img out/target/product/hammerhead/system</span><br><span>Creating filesystem with parameters:</span><br><span>    Size: 1073741824</span><br><span>    Block size: 4096</span><br><span>    Blocks per group: 32768</span><br><span>    Inodes per group: 8192</span><br><span>    Inode size: 256</span><br><span>    Journal blocks: 4096</span><br><span>    Label: system</span><br><span>    Blocks: 262144</span><br><span>    Block groups: 8</span><br><span>    Reserved block group size: 63</span><br><span>Created filesystem with 1445/65536 inodes and 85879/262144 blocks</span><br><span>Install system fs image: out/target/product/hammerhead/system.img</span><br><span>out/target/product/hammerhead/system.img+out/target/product/hammerhead/obj/PACKAGING/recovery_patch_intermediates/recovery_from_boot.p maxsize=1096212480 blocksize=135168 total=336629666 reserve=11083776</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"6. 刷机命令\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>6. 刷机命令</h3><p><strong>解锁 bootloader 和带 <code>-w</code> 的刷机都会清除用户数据。</strong> 先备份，再确认设备是 Nexus 5 / hammerhead、固件产物与设备匹配，且 bootloader 与基带满足该构建要求。</p><p>手机正常开机且 ADB 已授权时，可以运行 <code>adb reboot bootloader</code> 进入 bootloader / fastboot 模式。关机按键组合以 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/reference/fastboot-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">官方设备表</a>为准；它为 Nexus 5 列出音量上、音量下与电源键的组合。这里进入的是 fastboot 模式，和 recovery 不同。</p><p>先检查连接和产品名：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>fastboot devices</span><br><span>fastboot getvar product</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>若 bootloader 仍锁定，Nexus 5 这类 2015 年之前的设备使用 <code>fastboot oem unlock</code>，并在设备上确认清除数据与解锁；不要套用后来设备的 <code>fastboot flashing unlock</code>。细节见 <a href=\"https://source.android.com/docs/setup/test/running\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">官方 Fastboot 流程</a>。</p><p>在已执行 envsetup 和 <code>lunch aosp_hammerhead-userdebug</code> 的同一个终端中，确认 <code>ANDROID_PRODUCT_OUT</code> 指向本次 hammerhead 产物，再执行原刷机命令：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>echo</span> <span>&quot;<span>$ANDROID_PRODUCT_OUT</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span>fastboot -w flashall</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>旧 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/android-5.0.1_r1/fastboot/fastboot.c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fastboot 源码</a> 会从产物目录读取 <code>android-info.txt</code> 与镜像；仅仅 <code>cd</code> 到源码根目录并不能代替正确的构建环境。连接多个设备时，所有 fastboot 操作都应通过 <code>-s 设备序列号</code> 指定同一台目标设备。</p><p>下面是当时成功刷写的日志：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br><span>50</span><br><span>51</span><br><span>52</span><br><span>53</span><br><span>54</span><br><span>55</span><br><span>56</span><br><span>57</span><br><span>58</span><br><span>59</span><br><span>60</span><br><span>61</span><br><span>62</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>~/Android-SourceCode fastboot -w flashall</span><br><span>target reported max download size of 1073741824 bytes</span><br><span>Creating filesystem with parameters:</span><br><span>    Size: 13725835264</span><br><span>    Block size: 4096</span><br><span>    Blocks per group: 32768</span><br><span>    Inodes per group: 8144</span><br><span>    Inode size: 256</span><br><span>    Journal blocks: 32768</span><br><span>    Label:</span><br><span>    Blocks: 3351034</span><br><span>    Block groups: 103</span><br><span>    Reserved block group size: 823</span><br><span>Created filesystem with 11/838832 inodes and 93654/3351034 blocks</span><br><span>Creating filesystem with parameters:</span><br><span>    Size: 734003200</span><br><span>    Block size: 4096</span><br><span>    Blocks per group: 32768</span><br><span>    Inodes per group: 7472</span><br><span>    Inode size: 256</span><br><span>    Journal blocks: 2800</span><br><span>    Label:</span><br><span>    Blocks: 179200</span><br><span>    Block groups: 6</span><br><span>    Reserved block group size: 47</span><br><span>Created filesystem with 11/44832 inodes and 5813/179200 blocks</span><br><span>--------------------------------------------</span><br><span>Bootloader Version...: HHZ12d</span><br><span>Baseband Version.....: M8974A-2.0.50.2.22</span><br><span>Serial Number........: 08ade1a513dc087b</span><br><span>--------------------------------------------</span><br><span>checking product...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.100s]</span><br><span>sending &#x27;boot&#x27; (8950 KB)...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.500s]</span><br><span>writing &#x27;boot&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.784s]</span><br><span>sending &#x27;recovery&#x27; (9672 KB)...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.556s]</span><br><span>writing &#x27;recovery&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.814s]</span><br><span>erasing &#x27;system&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [  1.166s]</span><br><span>sending &#x27;system&#x27; (328187 KB)...</span><br><span>OKAY [ 10.501s]</span><br><span>writing &#x27;system&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [ 23.623s]</span><br><span>erasing &#x27;userdata&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [ 14.657s]</span><br><span>sending &#x27;userdata&#x27; (137318 KB)...</span><br><span>OKAY [  4.520s]</span><br><span>writing &#x27;userdata&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [  9.776s]</span><br><span>erasing &#x27;cache&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.618s]</span><br><span>sending &#x27;cache&#x27; (13348 KB)...</span><br><span>OKAY [  0.630s]</span><br><span>writing &#x27;cache&#x27;...</span><br><span>OKAY [  1.070s]</span><br><span>rebooting...</span><br><span></span><br><span>finished. total time: 70.095s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>刷写流程完成后还要确认能正常启动，并检查 Wi-Fi、相机、声音等所需功能。不要仅凭 fastboot 返回成功或出现桌面，就认定所有厂商二进制都匹配。</p><h3><a title=\"7. 秀桌面\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>7. 秀桌面</h3><p>最后秀一下当时的桌面：</p><p><img alt=\"Nexus 5 历史桌面截图\"></p><h1><a title=\"关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客</h1><p>下面是个人的介绍和相关的链接，期望与同行的各位多多交流，三人行，则必有我师!</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">博主个人介绍</a> ：里面有个人的微信和微信群链接。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2019/12/01/BlogMap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本博客内容导航</a> ：个人博客内容的一个导航。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2018/05/07/Android-performance-optimization-skills-and-tools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">个人整理和搜集的优秀博客文章 - Android 性能优化必知必会</a> ：欢迎大家自荐和推荐 （微信私聊即可）</li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2023/12/30/the-performance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android性能优化知识星球</a>：付费社群已于 2026 年停止运营，不再招收新成员；此处保留历史介绍。</li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>一个人可以走的更快 , 一群人可以走的更远</strong></p></blockquote><p><img alt=\"微信扫一扫\"></p>",
